==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Selena]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Bearkini]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the first Celeboodle for as long as you need to. When you are comfortable with hitting the base, send out an attacker to kill the Celeboodle and advance. Make sure you brought something to outrange the Bearkinis, like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragons]]. After the Bearkinis are gone, Selena attacks too infrequently to be a problem. Kill Selena and win.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Never Not Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Not Summer!]] stages, Leak Year's Japanese name, Shōben Jidai ("Piss Days") is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/uRHn8J8Ou7E Shōnen Jidai]" ("Boyhood Days") by [[wikipedia:Yosui Inoue|Yosui Inoue]].

